WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.212
Lab 1 needs only a laptop,
PowerShell 7 and Pester.

2
00:00:04.212 --> 00:00:08.467
First you send Microsoft's samples to
the fakes, and the tests show what you'd

3
00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:09.839
otherwise take on trust,

4
00:00:09.839 --> 00:00:13.338
including Learn's own update
quietly dropping a restriction.

5
00:00:13.338 --> 00:00:16.276
Then you compare the
policy and build its plan.

6
00:00:16.276 --> 00:00:19.457
It finds six restrictions
to add, one to change,

7
00:00:19.457 --> 00:00:22.387
and one to keep exactly
as the tenant has it.

8
00:00:22.387 --> 00:00:27.537
You dry-run the plan, apply it to the
fake, and then try a hash nobody approved.

9
00:00:27.537 --> 00:00:29.076
The script refuses.

10
00:00:29.076 --> 00:00:31.180
Next, the rotation half.
